# local secrets and data — never commit these.
# The glob is deliberately greedy: a mistyped `cp .env.example .env<pasted-key>`
# creates a file whose *name* is the secret, and `.env.*` would not match it.
.env*
!.env.example
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.tmp-*
